// =============================================================================
// 03-activator-detection.kql  —  Query dasar untuk Data Activator (Bagian D)
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Dipakai sebagai sumber trigger di Activator: mendeteksi kondisi kritis
// per device dalam jendela waktu berjalan. Ketika baris muncul, Activator
// dapat memicu aksi (mis. memanggil Azure Function -> Direct Method).
// =============================================================================

// Kondisi overheat: suhu >= 40C selama 2 pembacaan berturut dalam 30 detik.
telemetry
| extend enqueuedTime = ingestion_time()
| where enqueuedTime > ago(1m)
| summarize avgTemp = avg(temperature), samples = count()
    by deviceId, bin(enqueuedTime, 30s)
| where avgTemp >= 40.0 and samples >= 2
| project deviceId, window = enqueuedTime, avgTemp, alert = "OVERHEAT"
